    <briefdescription>
<para>Fixture for round-trip editor benchmarks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns an InMemoryDocumentStore and a StoreBackedRoundTripEditor. <ref refid="classthemis_1_1bench_1_1document_1_1_round_trip_fixture_1a7e3e69189d17cbf6d15ed727b8701023" kindref="member">SetUp()</ref> pre-populates one relay (&quot;preloaded_relay&quot;) with 11 snapshots (seed + 10 interactions) to provide stable targets for LoadInteractionLatency and CountSnapshotsLatency benchmarks.</para>
<para>All benchmarks that require unique relay IDs per iteration derive them from an atomic counter or a per-iteration string, ensuring no ERR_DOC_ALREADY_EXISTS errors from the underlying store.</para>
<para>Seed: kDocCanonicalSeed = 42. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
